d quiet, Erin must be furry.\n   - From the context, "If something is blue and furry then it is smart," since Erin is blue and furry, Erin must be smart.\n\n4. **Dave\'s characteristics:**.\n   - Dave is nice.\n   - From the context, "All nice things are big," since Dave is nice, Dave must be big.\n\nBased on the analysis, Dave is nice, and since all nice things are big, Dave must be big. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
