b is blue.**.\n  - According to the context, if someone is blue, they are furry.\n  - Therefore, Bob is furry.\n  .\n- **Bob is nice and smart.**.\n  - According to the context, nice, smart people are quiet.\n  - Therefore, Bob is quiet.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nBased on the given information, Bob is indeed quiet. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
