meone needs the tiger, the tiger sees the lion.\n   - If someone is cold and they see the lion, they need the tiger.\n\n2. **Analyzing the Mouse\'s Status:**.\n   - The mouse sees the lion.\n   - According to the context, if someone sees the lion, they are cold.\n   - Therefore, the mouse is cold.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nSince the mouse sees the lion and seeing the lion makes someone cold, the mouse is cold. Therefore, the statement "The mouse is not cold" is false.\n\n### Final Answer:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
