r.\n\n12. **All furry things are kind.**.\n    - Since Harry is not kind, Harry cannot be furry.\n\n13. **If Harry is young then Harry is cold.**.\n    - Since Harry is young, Harry must be cold.\n\n14. **If something is young and cold then it is furry.**.\n    - Since Harry is young and cold, Harry must be furry.\n\n### Conclusion:.\n- Harry is not green (from step 7 and step 8).\n- Harry is not red (from step 10). Therefore, my final option is: ']]
