ar then the bear is round.\n16. If the bear visits the mouse then the bear visits the cow.\n\n### Analysis:.\n1. **Bear\'s Characteristics:**.\n   - Young.\n   - Blue.\n\n2. **Bear\'s Actions:**.\n   - The bear chases the rabbit (from statement 7 and 16).\n   - The rabbit chases the bear (from statement 7).\n\n3. **Rabbit\'s Characteristics:**.\n   - Young (from statement 12).\n   - Does not visit the bear (from statement 16).\n\n4. **Cow\'s Characteristics:**.\n   - Chases the mouse (from statement 3).\n   - Eats the mouse (from statement 4).\n   - Does not visit the rabbit (from statement 5).\n\n5. **Bear\'s Actions and Characteristics:**.\n   - The bear chases the rabbit (from statement 7 and 16).\n   - The rabbit chases the bear (from statement 7).\n   - The bear is young and blue (from statements 1 and 2).\n\n6. **Bear\'s Potential Actions:**.\n   - Since the bear is young and blue, it visits the mouse (from statement 8).\n   - The bear visits the mouse (from statement 16).\n   - The bear visits the cow (from statement 16).\n\n### Conclusion:.\n- The bear visits the mouse (from statement 16).\n- The bear visits the cow (from statement 16).\n\nTherefore, the bear does visit the cow.\n\n### Final Answer:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
