 young.** (From point 13).\n\nSince Charlie is smart, he is also rough and quiet. Given that smart people are quiet, Charlie is quiet. Since smart people are also young, Charlie is young.\n\nNow, let\'s determine if Charlie is blue:.\n- **Blue, round people are rough.** (From point 8).\n- **If someone is round then they are blue.** (From point 11).\n\nSince Charlie is rough, he cannot be blue (because blue, round people are rough, and Charlie is not round). Therefore, Charlie is not blue. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
