 tiger, the tiger does not see the dog (from the context, if something sees the bald eagle then it eats the cow, and the dog eats the bald eagle).\n\nTherefore, the statement "The tiger does not see the dog" is true.\n\n### Conclusion:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
