young.\n- We know that white things are cold, and Erin is white and young.\n- We know that if something is young and furry, it is nice, but we don\'t have information about Charlie being furry.\n\n### Conclusion:.\n- We have no direct information about Charlie being cold.\n- We have no information that directly contradicts the statement "Charlie is cold.".\n- We have information about Dave and Gary being cold, but we don\'t know if Charlie is one of them.\n\nGiven the information, we cannot definitively say whether Charlie is cold or not. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
