, she cannot be round.\n\n7. **Green things are red.**.\n   - Since Fiona is not green, she cannot be red.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nBased on the given information, Fiona cannot be red because:.\n- She is not green (from point 3).\n- She is not furry (from point 4).\n- She is not smart (from point 5).\n- She is not round (from point 6).\n\nTherefore, the statement "Fiona is red" is **false**. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
