 is big.\n\n9. **All kind people are blue.**.\n   - Since Harry is kind, this tells us that Harry is blue.\n\n10. **If someone is big then they are nice.**.\n    - Since Harry is big, this tells us that Harry is nice.\n\nNow, let\'s summarize what we know about Gary:.\n- Gary is not big.\n- Gary is not cold.\n- Gary is not round (since if Gary were round, he would be big, which contradicts the given information).\n\nGiven that Gary is not round, and the statement "If someone is smart then they are kind" does not apply to Gary (since he is not round), we cannot determine if Gary is smart or not based on the given information. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
