pply to Fiona since we don\'t know if Fiona is nice.\n\n4. **Final Check:**.\n   - The only relevant statement that directly impacts Fiona\'s kindness is "Big, kind things are young." Since Fiona is big and not young, she cannot be kind.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nBased on the given information, Fiona is not kind.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
