Anne is big, then:.\n     - Young people are big (contradicts Anne being young).\n   - Therefore, Anne cannot be big.\n\n5. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Anne is young.\n   - Since Anne is young, she must be blue.\n   - Since Anne is blue, she must be quiet (as per the rule that red, big people are quiet and blue people are red).\n\nThus, based on the given information, Anne is quiet. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
