ment says all cold, white people are rough, Harry must be rough.\n\n5. **All rough people are furry.**.\n   - Since Harry is rough, Harry must be furry.\n\n6. **Erin is furry.**.\n   - Erin is described as furry.\n\n7. **Erin is nice.**.\n   - Erin is described as nice.\n\n8. **If someone is nice then they are big.**.\n   - Since Erin is nice, Erin must be big.\n\n9. **Furry, nice people are big.**.\n   - Since Erin is both furry and nice, Erin must be big, which is consistent with the previous statement.\n\n10. **All big people are red.**.\n    - Since Erin is big, Erin must be red.\n\n11. **All nice, big people are rough.**.\n    - Since Erin is both nice and big, Erin must be rough, which is consistent with the previous statement.\n\n12. **All furry, big people are cold.**.\n    - Since Erin is both furry and big, Erin must be cold, which is consistent with the previous statement.\n\n### Conclusion:.\n- Harry is white.\n- Harry is cold.\n- Harry is rough.\n- Harry is furry.\n- Harry is big.\n- Harry is red.\n\nSince Harry is white, the statement "Harry is not white" is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
