ince Fiona is round and big, by the rule "If someone is round and big, then they are young," Fiona is young.\n   - Since Fiona is round and big, by the rule "If someone is round and big, then they are nice," Fiona is nice.\n\nBased on the analysis, Fiona is both big, round, and nice. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
