ement.\n\n15. **If something is nice then it is kind.**.\n    - This is a general statement.\n\nNow, let\'s analyze Dave\'s characteristics:.\n- Dave is furry.\n- From the statement "If something is furry then it is big," we can conclude that Dave is big.\n- From the statement "If something is big then it is nice," we can conclude that Dave is nice.\n- From the statement "If something is nice then it is kind," we can conclude that Dave is kind.\n\nHowever, we need to determine if Dave is green. We know:.\n- Dave is big.\n- Young, big things are green (from statement 9 and 10).\n- If something is young, it is green (from statement 11).\n\nSince we don\'t have any information about Dave\'s age, we cannot definitively conclude whether Dave is young or not. Therefore, we cannot determine if Dave is green based on the given information. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
