s cold and not blue then it is rough.\n   - Since Erin is rough, Erin cannot be smart (because if Erin were smart, it would be rough, but it would also be green, which contradicts point 12).\n\n### Conclusion:.\nBased on the given information, Erin cannot be smart because if Erin were smart, it would have to be green, which contradicts the information that Erin is rough and not green.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Erin is smart" is **False**. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
