ce Erin is cold, if Erin were green, Erin would be big. However, we don\'t know if Erin is green, so we cannot conclude that Erin is big based on this statement alone.\n\n10. **If someone is furry and rough then they are big.**.\n    - Since Erin is furry, if Erin were rough, Erin would be big. However, we don\'t know if Erin is rough, so we cannot conclude that Erin is big based on this statement alone.\n\n11. **All furry people are smart.**.\n    - Since Erin is furry, Erin is smart.\n\n12. **Big, cold people are furry.**.\n    - Since Fiona is big and cold, Fiona is furry. This is consistent with Erin being furry.\n\nFrom the analysis, we can conclude that Erin is furry and therefore smart. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
