e is cold, but we don\'t have direct information that Dave is big. We know that round things are big, and Dave is round, so Dave is big.\n   - Dave is young, as stated in the context.\n\nSince Dave is cold, big, and young, and all cold, big things are furry, we can conclude that Dave is furry. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
