int 10), we need to check if Gary is quiet.\n- If Gary is nice and quiet, then he must be rough (from point 11).\n\nSince Gary is nice and young, and we know that young people are cold, and if someone is quiet and nice, they are rough, Gary must be rough. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
