e mouse must chase the bear because:.\n- The mouse chases the cow.\n- The cow chases the squirrel.\n- Therefore, the mouse visits the bear (since the mouse chases the cow and the cow chases the squirrel). Therefore, my final option is: ']] 70%|######9   | 419/600 [05:56<00:09, 19.54it/s]
