d and round people are white, Charlie is white.\n- **Big:** Since Charlie is round and white, and all round, rough people are big, Charlie must be big.\n- **Cold:** Since Charlie is not young, and all young, big people are not cold, Charlie cannot be cold.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nBased on the given information, Charlie is not cold.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
