rom point 6).\n- Since Gary is round, from point 12, Gary is quiet.\n- From point 15, if something is round and quiet, it is green. However, this doesn\'t directly help us determine Gary\'s youngness.\n- From point 13, if something is young, it is round. Since Gary is round, we need to check if Gary is young.\n- From point 14, all red, round things are young. Since Gary is round, we need to check if Gary is red.\n- From point 2, Bob is red. Since Gary is kind and round, and all red, round things are young, Gary must be young.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nGary is round and quiet, and since all red, round things are young, Gary must be young.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Gary is young" is **True**. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
